  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
        <h1>Clear prices. <em>Paid back in months.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead hero__say">AI takes over work your team does by hand. A 40-person firm spends <strong class="plain"><span data-zar="120000">R120,000</span></strong> and gets about <b>208 hours a month</b> back: paid off in about <b><span data-payback>3</span> months</b>.</p>
        <p class="small muted aid-note">Every price and every ongoing cost is on this page, and fixed in your proposal before anything is built.</p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <a href="#roi" class="btn btn--primary" data-track="cta-pricing-roi">Work out yours</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-review-open data-track="cta-pricing-tell">Tell us what&rsquo;s slowing you down</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AT A GLANCE -->
    <section class="section" id="starting" aria-labelledby="startTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">At a glance</span>
          <h2 id="startTitle">What things cost.</h2>
          <p>Starting prices. Your proposal fixes the exact scope and price before any development.</p>
          <p class="cur-line">Prices in <span class="cur-pick" role="group" aria-label="Show prices in"><button type="button" data-cur="ZAR" aria-pressed="true">ZAR</button><button type="button" data-cur="USD" aria-pressed="false">USD</button><button type="button" data-cur="EUR" aria-pressed="false">EUR</button><button type="button" data-cur="GBP" aria-pressed="false">GBP</button></span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="glance reveal">
          <div class="price-group" id="websites">
            <h3>Fix one problem</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">A fixed price for a defined scope.</p>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><a href="ai-demos">AI solution<small>Enquiries read and replies drafted, or answers found in your documents</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="ai-for-business#library">Automation<small>One task your team types by hand every week, done for them</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="services#dashboards">Dashboard<small>The numbers you chase every week, in one place, kept up to date</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="services#software">Custom software<small>Your systems connected, so nothing is typed in twice</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="45000">R45,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="services#websites">Business website<small>Found on Google, and enquiries arrive ready to act on</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="services#websites">Platform or web app<small>Customers book, pay or log in without calling you</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="price-group">
            <h3>Take over a whole process, in stages</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">You can stop after any stage.</p>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><a href="#implementation">Discovery<small>We map the work and measure it today &middot; 1&ndash;2 weeks &middot; credited if you go ahead</small></a><span class="price"><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="#implementation">Proof of concept<small>A small working version, tested on real work &middot; 2&ndash;4 weeks</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="#implementation">Production<small>Connected to your systems, documented, your team trained</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="85000">R85,000</span></span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="price-group" id="care">
            <h3>Keep it running</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">Monthly, listed in your proposal.</p>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><span class="pl-name">Managed hosting<small>Secure, backed up, monitored</small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="450">R450</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Care<small>Hosting plus an hour of changes a month</small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="1450">R1,450</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="#operations">Operate<small>One AI system watched, fixed and reported on</small></a><span class="price"><span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="#operations">Optimise<small>Up to three systems, improved every month</small></a><span class="price"><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="#operations">Partner<small>All your systems, fastest response</small></a><span class="price"><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ ROI CALCULATOR ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="roi" aria-labelledby="roiTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Is it worth it?</span>
          <h2 id="roiTitle">What is that work costing you?</h2>
          <p>A rough estimate in ten seconds. Discovery replaces it with a measured one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="roi reveal" data-roi>
          <div class="roi__inputs">
            <label class="roi__field"><span>People doing this work</span><output data-roi-out="people">3</output><input type="range" name="people" min="1" max="50" value="3" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Hours each spends on it per week</span><output data-roi-out="hours">5</output><input type="range" name="hours" min="1" max="40" value="5" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Their monthly salary (<span data-cur-code>ZAR</span>)</span><output data-roi-out="salary">R25,000</output><input type="range" name="salary" min="8000" max="120000" step="1000" value="25000" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Share of that work a system could take over</span><output data-roi-out="share">60%</output><input type="range" name="share" min="20" max="90" step="5" value="60" /></label>
          </div>
          <div class="roi__out" aria-live="polite">
            <div><span>Hours back every month</span><b data-roi="hours">0</b></div>
            <div><span>Value of that time, per month</span><b data-roi="month">R0</b></div>
            <div class="roi__big"><span>Per year</span><b data-roi="year">R0</b></div>
            <p class="tiny muted">Hours × loaded cost (salary × 1.3 ÷ 173 hours). An estimate, not a promise: we measure the real figure in discovery.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--full" data-review-open data-track="cta-roi">Tell us about it</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form class="sendme reveal" data-sendme="roi" novalidate>
          <p class="sendme__t">Keep this estimate? We&rsquo;ll email you the numbers.</p>
          <div class="sendme__row">
            <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" aria-label="Your email address" />
            <input type="text" name="business" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Business (optional)" aria-label="Business name (optional)" />
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--small">Email it to me</button>
          </div>
          <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0" />
          <p class="tiny muted sendme__msg" data-sendme-msg aria-live="polite">We&rsquo;ll send it once and may follow up once. <a class="inline-link" href="privacy">Privacy</a></p>
        </form>
        <details class="fold reveal">
          <summary><span>Worked example</span> <span data-zar="120000">R120,000</span> to build · ~208 hours back a month · paid back in ~<span data-payback-x>3.3</span> months</summary>
          <div class="fold__body">
            <p class="small muted">Example numbers for enquiry handling. Yours come from your own baseline in discovery.</p>
        <div class="ex">
              <table class="spec">
                <caption>Cost</caption>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td>Discovery</td><td class="price"><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Proof of concept</td><td class="price"><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Production implementation</td><td class="price"><span data-zar="85000">R85,000</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Less discovery credit</td><td class="price">−<span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td><strong>Implementation, total</strong></td><td class="price"><strong><span data-zar="120000">R120,000</span></strong></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Operations (Operate)</td><td class="price"><span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/mo</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
              <table class="spec">
                <caption>Value</caption>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td>8 people × 10 hours a week on enquiries</td><td class="price">346 h/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Share the system takes over (measured)</td><td class="price">60%</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Hours back</td><td class="price">208 h/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>At <span data-ex="salary">R28,000</span> salary (loaded ≈ <span data-ex="hourly">R210</span>/h)</td><td class="price"><span data-ex="value">R43,730</span>/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Less operations</td><td class="price">−<span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><strong>Payback</strong></td><td class="price"><strong>≈ <span data-payback-x>3.3</span> months</strong></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p class="small muted">Hours × loaded cost (salary × 1.3 ÷ 173). Revenue effects such as faster replies winning more work are reported separately, and only when measured. <a class="inline-link" href="method#measure">How we measure</a></p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- IMPLEMENTATION -->
    <section class="section" id="implementation" aria-labelledby="implTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Larger AI process work</span>
          <h2 id="implTitle">When the job is bigger than a fixed-scope build.</h2>
          <p>Automating a whole process across your software is done in stages you can stop between. Each stage ends with something you keep and a decision, and nothing goes to production before it has proved itself on your work.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="stages reveal">
          <li><div><span class="stages__k">Start here</span><h3>Process review</h3><p>30 minutes. Where the time goes, whether AI is the answer, and what we&rsquo;d look at first.</p></div><b>Free</b></li>
          <li><div><span class="stages__k">Phases 1–2 · 1–2 weeks</span><h3>Discovery &amp; opportunity map</h3><p>Process map, baseline measurements, every opportunity scored, an ROI estimate and a recommended first build. Yours to keep. Credited in full against implementation if you go ahead within 60 days.</p></div><b><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></b></li>
          <li><div><span class="stages__k">Phases 3–4 · 2–4 weeks</span><h3>Proof of concept</h3><p>The smallest useful version, on real work, measured before vs after. Go, adjust or stop.</p></div><b><small>from</small> <span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></b></li>
          <li><div><span class="stages__k">Phases 5–6 · fixed quote</span><h3>Production implementation</h3><p>Integrated with your software, with permissions, logging and safe fallbacks, documented, and your team trained.</p></div><b><small>from</small> <span data-zar="85000">R85,000</span></b></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="small muted section__foot reveal">A 40% deposit starts each paid stage and comes off its price; the balance is due on completion. Larger implementations can be split across milestones. <a class="inline-link" href="terms">Terms</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OPERATIONS -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="operations" aria-labelledby="opsTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Operations</span>
          <h2 id="opsTitle">Run, measured and improved, every month.</h2>
          <p>Starts at go-live, with a 3-month minimum and then month to month. Every plan includes monitoring, AI usage up to its allowance, maintenance, security updates, usage monitoring, evaluation, support to the SLA, improvement hours, and a monthly ROI report.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid plans plans--3">
          <div class="card plan reveal">
            <h3>Operate</h3>
            <div class="plan__price"><span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span><small>/month</small></div>
            <p>For one system: we keep it working, fix what breaks and show you the results every month.</p>
            <ul><li>1 system covered</li><li>AI usage (what the AI provider charges) up to <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> a month</li><li>2 hours a month for optimisation</li><li>Accuracy check every quarter, against real examples</li><li>Monthly ROI report</li><li>Support: next business day</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card plan plan--featured reveal">
            <span class="plan__flag">Most chosen</span>
            <h3>Optimise</h3>
            <div class="plan__price"><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span><small>/month</small></div>
            <p>For up to three systems: everything in Operate, plus time each month to make them better.</p>
            <ul><li>Up to 3 systems</li><li>AI usage (what the AI provider charges) up to <span data-zar="4000">R4,000</span> a month</li><li>6 hours a month for workflow improvements and small integrations</li><li>Accuracy check every month, against real examples</li><li>Monthly ROI report, quarterly roadmap review</li><li>Support: within 4 business hours</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card plan reveal">
            <h3>Partner</h3>
            <div class="plan__price"><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span><small>/month</small></div>
            <p>For businesses running several systems: all of them looked after, with the fastest response.</p>
            <ul><li>All systems in the agreement</li><li>AI usage (what the AI provider charges) up to <span data-zar="10000">R10,000</span> a month</li><li>15 hours a month, unused hours roll over one month</li><li>Accuracy check every month, against real examples</li><li>Monthly ROI report and review call, monthly roadmap</li><li>Support: within 2 business hours; critical within 1</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="center small muted section__foot reveal">AI usage above the allowance is billed at cost, and we warn you at 80%. Unused hours don&rsquo;t roll over, except on Partner (one month).</p>

        <details class="fold reveal" id="sla">
          <summary><span>Service levels</span> Response times by plan, and what counts as critical</summary>
          <div class="fold__body">
            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table class="spec spec--sla">
                <caption>Service levels</caption>
                <thead><tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">Operate</th><th scope="col">Optimise</th><th scope="col">Partner</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Critical: down, or wrong outputs at scale</th><td>Next business day</td><td>4 business hours</td><td>1 business hour</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">High: a part failing, with a workaround</th><td>Next business day</td><td>4 business hours</td><td>2 business hours</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Normal: questions and requests</th><td>2 business days</td><td>Next business day</td><td>4 business hours</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Monitoring &amp; alerts</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Security updates &amp; maintenance</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Accuracy check</th><td>Quarterly</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Monthly</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p class="small muted">Business hours are Monday to Friday, 08:00–17:00 SAST, excluding public holidays. Response time is a person acknowledging the issue with a first assessment, not a guaranteed fix time. We monitor the AI providers we use but can&rsquo;t guarantee their uptime; we guarantee how fast we respond and that your system falls back safely.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EVERYTHING ELSE -->
    <section class="section" id="separate" aria-labelledby="sepTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Everything else</span>
          <h2 id="sepTitle">Outside the scope? It has a price before it starts.</h2>
          <p>That&rsquo;s what keeps implementation fixed and operations predictable. Small changes come out of your plan&rsquo;s hours first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glance glance--2 reveal">
          <div class="price-group">
            <h3>Priced separately</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">Agreed before any work starts.</p>
            <ul class="price-list">
              <li><span class="pl-name">Change requests<small>Beyond your plan&rsquo;s hours, quoted before work starts</small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="1250">R1,250</span><span class="per">/hour</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">New functionality<small>A new capability is its own project, with its own fixed quote</small></span><span class="price">Quoted</span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Consulting &amp; workshops<small>Half-day workshop <span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span></small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="1850">R1,850</span><span class="per">/hour</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Emergency support<small>Outside business hours, 1-hour minimum</small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="2450">R2,450</span><span class="per">/hour</span></span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="price-group" id="ongoing">
            <h3>Passed through at cost</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">Listed in your proposal, never added later.</p>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><span class="pl-name">Third-party subscriptions<small>Software you choose to use, billed by the provider</small></span><span class="price">At cost</span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">AI usage<small>What the AI provider charges, never marked up</small></span><span class="price">At cost</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="faq" aria-labelledby="pricingFaqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Pricing questions</span>
          <h2 id="pricingFaqTitle">Common questions about cost.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item" id="process"><summary>How does a project work?</summary><ol class="faq__steps"><li><b>Tell us the problem</b> in your own words.</li><li><b>We propose a solution:</b> the simplest thing that works, which isn&rsquo;t always AI.</li><li><b>You get a fixed proposal.</b> Approve it and pay a 40% deposit.</li><li><b>We build it and you review it.</b> Agreed changes within the scope are included.</li><li><b>Pay the balance and we launch.</b> You own it.</li></ol><p>Deposits, revisions, payment, ownership and handover are in the <a class="inline-link" href="terms">terms</a>.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item" id="cost"><summary>What affects the cost?</summary><ul class="faq__steps"><li><b>Scope:</b> how many pages, screens, steps or users.</li><li><b>Integrations:</b> how many systems it connects to, and whether they have a way in.</li><li><b>Complexity:</b> the rules, exceptions and approvals it has to handle.</li><li><b>Data:</b> whether your information is ready to use or needs cleaning first.</li><li><b>Ongoing needs:</b> how much support, monitoring and change you want afterwards.</li></ul></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What do I get at the starting price?</summary><p>A well-defined first project: a business website, a dashboard from your main systems, one automated workflow, one focused AI tool, or a focused custom tool. More pages, sources, integrations or users add to the price, and your proposal shows exactly what&rsquo;s included.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Why doesn&rsquo;t every project cost the starting price?</summary><p>Because a one-page site and a booking system with payments are both &ldquo;websites&rdquo;, but they&rsquo;re not the same work. Starting prices tell you where a project begins; the fixed proposal tells you what yours costs, before anything is built.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Why isn&rsquo;t discovery free?</summary><p>Because it&rsquo;s the most valuable part: a map of your processes, measured baselines and a scored list of opportunities. You keep it whether or not you build with us, and it&rsquo;s credited in full if you do within 60 days. The process review before it is free.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can we stop after the proof of concept?</summary><p>Yes. That&rsquo;s what it&rsquo;s for. If the measured result doesn&rsquo;t justify production, we&rsquo;ll say so, and you&rsquo;ve only paid for the proof of concept.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Why is Operations a monthly fee?</summary><p>AI systems aren&rsquo;t finished at go-live. Models change, your processes change, and accuracy drifts if nobody checks it. Operations covers the model and API costs, monitoring, security, evaluation, support and improvements, and proves the value every month.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What if our AI usage goes above the allowance?</summary><p>We warn you at 80% of the allowance. Anything above it is billed at cost, never marked up. If it keeps happening, we&rsquo;ll suggest the plan or design change that brings it down.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do you build websites?</summary><p>Yes: business websites from <span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span> and platforms from <span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span>, with a fixed proposal first, plus managed hosting or Care. They&rsquo;re priced and run separately from the AI work.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="pricingCtaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <h2 id="pricingCtaTitle">Have a question before committing?</h2>
        <p>Ask it. Tell us what you&rsquo;re trying to improve and we&rsquo;ll tell you honestly what it would cost, including the ongoing part.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--light btn--large" data-review-open data-track="cta-pricing-final">Tell us what&rsquo;s slowing you down</button>
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--large">Get an estimate</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
